  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "AI與金融創新專題",
    "sub_ename": "AI AND FINANCIAL INNOVATION SEMINAR",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以科技管理與服務創新為理論基礎，探討人工智慧於金融服務業的應用。課程內容涵蓋個體層級的消費者行為、組織層級的AI導入與雙元創新策略，以及產業層級的金融科技擴散與監理科技發展。透過學術文獻與實務案例的討論，學生將深入理解AI如何促進金融服務的數位轉型與顧客價值共創，並培養批判性思維，進而具備評估AI創新應用效益與風險的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is grounded in the theoretical foundations of technology management and service innovation, focusing on the application of artificial intelligence (AI) in the financial services industry. Topics span three levels: consumer behavior at the individual level, AI adoption and organizational ambidexterity at the organizational level, and the diffusion of FinTech and development of RegTech at the industry level. Through critical discussions of academic research and practical case studies, students will understand how AI drives digital transformation and value co-creation in financial services. The course also emphasizes developing critical thinking skills to enhance students’ ability to assess the benefits and risks of AI-driven innovation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解AI在金融服務中於個人、組織與產業層級的創新應用",
      "describe_en": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "融合科技管理與服務創新理論，探討AI應用於金融創新",
      "describe_en": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "認知AI於金融創新應用的潛在效益與風險。",
      "describe_en": null
    }
